        "id": 117469,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-12T12:46:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Mezike\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Mezike:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Greywind wrote:</b><br>\n<blockquote>Heating the base to expand has one small problem. The hole will contract as the plastic expands. Not dilate.\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<p>I’m just waiting for Pydro to swing by again…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Me too!</p>",
