        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-12T18:54:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>After years of dealing with Gamesworkshop and their idea of ‘quality’ minis, I have no complaint of these. I may just be jaded. But the flexibility is a plus to me, given how rough play time can be. No chance of accidental snappage of say, proletariat s hammer top, or some of the citiziens appendages/ weapons.</p>\n<p>Detail wise I’ve seen better, but for the price it’s not bad at all to me. Several unique sculpts in one box is pretty on par for what I’m used to.</p>",
